<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise unit in 700 mln Ffr water deal.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise unit in 700 mln Ffr water deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Degremont, a Lyonnaise des Eaux unit, and OTV, a subsidiary of Cie Generale des Eaux said on Thursday they have won a 700 million franc contract to expand a water purification plant.</p>
<p>Studies on the plant are due to start at the beginning of 1997, with the factory expected to be finished by 2001. The factory will be at Valenton, in the Val de Marne region east of Paris.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
